{"seq":18,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T02:35:40.484Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"913ba95ff3d538b15f970697aa9abae9b66e88e0978d9bf6f109947d2c764b00","actor":"assistant","via":"gbrain","tool":"gbrain.search","kind":"read","args":{"query":"Orlavine Quillfeather","match":"keyword"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"pages":["heldout/notes/2026-06-01-strategic-qbr-plan","heldout/agent-notes/2025-03-10-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2026-09-30-strategic-digest"],"count":3,"latency_ms":71,"sources":["public"],"facts":[{"fact":"Ruth Calloway (ruth-calloway, Chief Revenue Officer; runs the Strategic Accounts pod) wrote in #strategic-pod on 2026-10-14 09:00: Per Moss's Strategic digests, who owns each Strategic account today: Vantorre Group, Vantorre Mobility, Orlavine Medical Supply and Quillfeather Outfitters? And on what date did Vantorre Group change hands? I am updating the board slide.","id":1,"source":"ruth-calloway, #strategic-pod, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ruth-calloway"}
{"seq":19,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T02:35:53.085Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4d3066c90cc41e88339846c1bd36297c753b5acf81328dec90c974653183fc3b","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, from Moss's digests, the account owners are:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on **2026-05-04**, when it moved from Nadia Fennimore. Moss's 5/4 digest records the CRM reassignment, and Gideon confirmed in #inc-vtg-hartford on 8/3 that it's his account.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 4/27 and 9/30 digests both list it as his fleet account. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" that day, which doesn't match the 2025 digests that already called it his, so the start date is unclear.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest calls it \"Gideon's medical account.\" A March 2025 digest called it Nadia's, so that is older.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't find a clear owner. The 9/30 digest only has Nadia hosting a training session for the account, which doesn't establish ownership.\n\nThe digests contradict each other on a few points, and Moss's cheat sheet still lists Vantorre Group as Nadia's. Before the board slide goes out, it's worth confirming the Vantorre Mobility and Orlavine owners and Quillfeather's owner with Moss or Gideon."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
